<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Japan Travel Guide | Heritage & Harmony</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #b91c1c;
            --accent: #f97316;
            --dark: #141010;
            --muted: #6b6b6b;
            --bg: #f7f3f0;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --pill: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.12);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Poppins', 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.7;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(1200px, 92%);
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .top-nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .top-nav .brand {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .nav-links a {
            margin-left: 20px;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 90vh;
            padding: 40px 0 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(20,16,16,0.9), rgba(20,16,16,0.55)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1480796927426-f609979314bd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-content {
            margin-top: 80px;
        }

        .hero-kicker {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
            margin: 20px 0 15px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 640px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            margin: 30px 0 40px;
        }

        .cta {
            padding: 14px 26px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            color: inherit;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
        }

        .cta.primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .cta:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .hero-meta {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        }

        .hero-meta strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        section {
            padding: clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px) 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-subtitle {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .story-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .story-card {
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 26px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(20,16,16,0.06);
        }

        .story-card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .stat-card strong {
            font-size: 2.6rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .filters-panel {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 30px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(20,16,16,0.08);
        }

        .filter-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .pill-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .pill {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--pill);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .pill.active {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }

        .search-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }

        .search-wrapper input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px 12px 38px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .search-icon {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 14px;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .filter-note {
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .grid-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 28px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(20,16,16,0.08);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .card-image {
            position: relative;
            height: 220px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .area-badge {
            position: absolute;
            right: 16px;
            bottom: 16px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
            color: white;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 26px;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .jp-label {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .card-highlight {
            background: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.08);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .card-meta {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .season-tag {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .card-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .map-btn {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
        }

        .map-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
        }

        .season-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .season-card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .season-card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .empty-state {
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
            border-radius: 22px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .hero-content {
                margin-top: 40px;
            }

            .hero-meta {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .card-footer {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="container">
            <nav class="top-nav">
                <span class="brand">Japan Travel Guide</span>
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <a href="#story">Heritage</a>
                    <a href="#destinations">Destinations</a>
                    <a href="#seasons">Seasons</a>
                </div>
            </nav>
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="hero-kicker">HERITAGE & HARMONY</span>
                <h1>時代を紡ぐ島国の息遣いを、あなたの旅路へ。</h1>
                <p>日本は外来文化をしなやかに受け入れ、自らの美意識で磨き上げてきました。神話の黎明から現代テクノロジーまで、47都道府県の土地それぞれが誇り高き物語をたたえています。</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="cta primary" href="#destinations">旅先を見つける</a>
                    <a class="cta" href="#story">想いを読む</a>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <div>
                        <strong id="hero-count">0</strong>
                        <span>精選スポット</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>47</strong>
                        <span>都道府県の個性</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>4</strong>
                        <span>季節の表情</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="story">
            <div class="container">
                <p class="section-title">誇りが息づく、日本の物語</p>
                <p class="section-subtitle">島国ならではの距離感が、古来からの精神性と世界最先端の創造性を共鳴させています。</p>
                <div class="story-grid">
                    <article class="story-card">
                        <h3>古の記憶</h3>
                        <p>社寺仏閣や街道の石畳からは、千年以上連綿と続く祈りの文化が感じられます。静寂の中で聞こえる風鈴の音が、旅人の心を整えてくれます。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="story-card">
                        <h3>現代の躍動</h3>
                        <p>ネオンやデジタルアートを纏う都市は、伝統を尊びながら未来を描きます。アニメ、ゲーム、テックの最前線も路地裏の工房も同じ熱量で輝きます。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="story-card">
                        <h3>自然の呼吸</h3>
                        <p>火山が育てた温泉、雪解けが描く棚田、波が磨いた海岸線。四季折々の光景が旅人に心身の休息と新たな気づきを与えてくれます。</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="insights">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="stats-grid">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <strong>25</strong>
                        <p>UNESCO 世界遺産（文化/自然）</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <strong>3000+</strong>
                        <p>登録有形文化財</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <strong>1300年</strong>
                        <p>西暦710年から続く都の記憶</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <strong>∞</strong>
                        <p>旅人を魅了する出会い</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="filters">
            <div class="container">
                <p class="section-title">行き先をカスタマイズ</p>
                <p class="section-subtitle">季節やエリア、体験で絞り込み、あなただけの旅路を描きましょう。</p>
                <div class="filters-panel">
                    <div class="filter-group">
                        <label>エリアで探す</label>
                        <div class="pill-group" id="area-filters"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="filter-group">
                        <label>季節の魅力</label>
                        <div class="pill-group" id="season-filters"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="filter-group">
                        <label>キーワード</label>
                        <div class="search-wrapper">
                            <span class="search-icon">⌕</span>
                            <input id="search-input" type="search" placeholder="例: 神社, 夜景, 温泉">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="filter-note">表示中: <strong id="results-count">0</strong> 件</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="destinations">
            <div class="container">
                <p class="section-title">全国の珠玉スポット</p>
                <div id="spot-grid" class="grid-container"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="seasons">
            <div class="container">
                <p class="section-title">四季が織りなす旅のテーマ</p>
                <div class="season-grid">
                    <article class="season-card">
                        <h3>春 | Hanami</h3>
                        <p>桜の香りとともに、社殿の朱とピンクのグラデーションが広がります。朝霧に包まれた庭園での茶会もおすすめ。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="season-card">
                        <h3>夏 | Matsuri</h3>
                        <p>太鼓のリズムに乗って踊る夜。提灯の明かりと屋台の匂いが、心を高鳴らせます。離島での星空観測も忘れずに。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="season-card">
                        <h3>秋 | Koyo</h3>
                        <p>錦秋が山々を染め、渓谷を黄金色に輝かせます。禅寺の庭で紅葉が舞う様は、誰もを静寂へと誘います。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="season-card">
                        <h3>冬 | Snow & Onsen</h3>
                        <p>雪国の合掌造り集落やライトアップされた運河は幻想的。湯けむりに包まれて、旅の疲れを癒しましょう。</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2024 Japan Travel Guide Project — 日本の誇りを世界へ。</p>
    </footer>

